Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What an unpleasant wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Win, I don't feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people aren't enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave them medicine brewed with Reishi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Reishi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean Mannentake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(211.2,19.2)\i1}Mannentake = Lingzhi.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It has detoxifying effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hh, you really know your stuff, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It also has the power to combat darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This way is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.00,0:01:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If she rest a bit, \Nshe'll get better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had noticed a little sooner...\NI'm sorry Lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.30,0:01:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. \NThank you for stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Er... nice to meet you Moriguchi Hiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.37,0:01:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply breaking the barrier... 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't purge my darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect...Hiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Uaaaah!\NWhat is all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it with things gathered around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Together with the two of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Together, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo-san is amazing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.00,0:03:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we even help out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.70,0:03:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten since yesterday, \Nso I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see you have an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, \Nplease have some mushroom tempura too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We gathered all of these together as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika-san, you've got a great appetite!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you've recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This really warms the heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no... I just mean eating a meal together \Nlike this is a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.40,0:04:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?I thought you didn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you cut it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Hiyo-chan, aren't you a bit too good at cooking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was taught by my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's currently hospitalized due to illness, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my father when I was very young,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so I've always lived with just my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As I helped out around the house with \Ncooking, cleaning, and laundry,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to that, \NI'm totally fine on my own now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:05:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But aren't you lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.90,0:05:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuu is here, so I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.50,0:05:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.00,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the home of the deity Kusabira.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kusabi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a deity that has been protecting this forest for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the deity is here, this area remains peaceful, and \Nwe’re blessed with an abundance of delicious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Kusabiragami-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When your mother was a child, she once got lost in the forest and was helped by someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you really are a good kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.20,0:06:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Kusabiragami-sama, \Nthis is Hiyo, my precious daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.00,0:06:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please continue to watch over and protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Kuu. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.30,0:06:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since then, Mom, Kuu, \Nand I began living as three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.80,0:06:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.20,0:06:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Niika-san? 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom is honestly super annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here. \NIsn't pretty much every family the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.50,0:06:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In my case, I almost died in an accident once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.80,0:06:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.16,0:07:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And ever since then, \Nmy mom worries about absolutely everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That just means Niika-san is precious to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, of course, but it always ends up turning into a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.00,0:07:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, it was like that all the time \Nuntil my mom was hospitalized.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Being apart like this makes you realize how much \Nyour mother actually does for you, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.70,0:07:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I hope Hiyo-chan's mom gets better soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.00,0:07:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They're such nice people, \Nboth Win-san and Niika-san. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.00,0:07:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lost. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If my mom got sick and you hadn't listened to my worries,\N I wouldn't have known what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:08:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be of help. \NI didn't want you to end up like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Lost buying this card from me, \NI'm able to receive the latest medical treatments.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.41,0:08:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother, you know, recently the days when \Nshe feels well have been increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So I think she'll get better with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.66,0:08:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could be of help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.53,0:08:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a treasure I received from my mom, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,there is nothing more important than my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad it was Lost who reached out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're.... danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, calling this a guardian deity of this degree...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.60,0:09:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.20,0:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.05,0:10:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,what's wrong? \NYour whole body is battered!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo, run away! 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.00,0:10:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo, run! \NHiyo, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz329.3\fs14\pos(211.2,164.267)}Nasu 3rd Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz329.3\fs14\pos(254.4,72.533)}Incoming call
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz329.3\fs14\pos(166.4,185.6)}Decline
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz329.3\fs14\pos(211.2,219.733)}Accept
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Moriguchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.45,0:11:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm refreshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.50,0:11:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, where's Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him. \NHiyo-chan hasn't been around either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.66,0:11:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they go for a walk or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? \NWhat did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom... died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Lost didn't come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring {\i1}that{\i0} guy with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.00,0:11:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom was fine until {\i1}he{\i0} showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.00,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She was laughing and feeling well even yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.93,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuu told me. 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:11:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Win brought something bad with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No way... \NI...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.20,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back! \NGive me back the Crystal Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That card is the treasure my mom gave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.50,0:12:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Saying things like that now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give it back! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.30,0:12:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back the Crystal Card! \NHurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Lost and Hiyo-chan are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You were late. \NI don't care about you at all anymore! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.45,0:12:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The Crystal Card is already mine! 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.80,0:12:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost... 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Crystal Card, I will... 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.66,0:12:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Get Mom back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.00,0:13:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you plan to do with the Crystal Card? \NTell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.80,0:13:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back my treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your fault! 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me do something 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.00,0:13:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,LIKE THIS TO YOU!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo-san! \NHiyo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mistake... \NIt wasn't me...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.10,0:14:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me! 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz346.9\pos(254.4,104.533)}Call cannot be completed
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frz0.3236\pos(208.8,18.133)\i1}119 - Japan's emergency number for ambulance and fire services{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.37,0:14:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, there's no signal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Kusabiragami!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo, wake up. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.79,0:15:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.50,0:15:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo, give her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Kusabiragami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.50,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Jashin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Words cannot reach one like that anymore. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.37,0:15:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The current thing has lost its ego.\NIt's just a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Decide, Win. 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you defeat it, 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.37,0:15:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,or die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that. 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.54,0:16:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kusabiragami just wants to save Hiyo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph, do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.00,0:16:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.50,0:16:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Kusabiragami! \NListen to what I have to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo-san wouldn't want something like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.40,0:17:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Kusabiragami! 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,With this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.12,0:18:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I AM!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I really have no other choice? 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,DAMN IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you finally made up your mind to defeat it, 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.47,0:18:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Win?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't misunderstand! 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.91,0:18:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I called you here to stop Kusabiragami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That softness is your weakness. \NOther than killing it, it will not stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it already, Kusabiragami! 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.00,0:19:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's save Hiyo-san together! \NThere's still time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.00,0:19:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand its pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,, Make it end quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Jashin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Kusabiragami...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Unleash the darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Win. 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.00,0:20:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuu...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo-san! \NHiyo-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it come to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hiyo... 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.70,0:22:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,DAMN IT... \NDAMN IT... \NDAMN IT...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.80,0:22:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A world like this... just...
